{"sha":"23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDIzYjgzYWQ1MGY2M2QyNDFkMDA2OWEzZGM0MjZkNDNiMjExYWRmMmU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-21T21:14:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-21T21:14:50Z"},"message":"feat(code): add `editable` trace metadata (#5737)\n\nDeep Agents Code traces now expose whether the client is an editable\ninstall as a filterable boolean.\n\n---\n\nTrace consumers currently must parse `lc_versions[\"deepagents-code\"]`\nfor a `+editable` suffix. `build_stream_config` now emits an\nalways-present `editable` boolean derived from the same cached PEP 610\nlookup, keeping both values consistent.\n\nTests: focused metadata contract and stream-config tests; `make\nformat_diff`; `make lint_diff`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/6e666be6-44be-5afd-abb0-945fac4d7912)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac5089a522457731e576e63b5562d120f3b74c40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/ac5089a522457731e576e63b5562d120f3b74c40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiL/KCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzpEQAANjbhkcXIoJFqH39o1oWT9g\nRzOpCNzI1NGoWtVtf8hPcbOR7djgjWgTSwaPyRG6G0C6d8wTze63CTMBZCvG8iv3\nsgVhCUykr48wVSwrbpQO+J7Gk1t2UHykbTLqxrLHUlrQP662weuzrzvq93k2gBo/\n/INN8QVAfKiJvmibmjv3gL412pVeR2/1uE+aPTjwiecYO/Dpl6exEmIesRLewJDV\nxfCqBnK9pNfo6LwFbs4e3G9Reha4gMHeDEMXsRt+t8Ik1e+6yLTWEi/nD8BKSrcK\nxcM3IesSDvLk//iuIUvIWn73R7yRk54QaKrl7+bn9ndMrBfV8KrmmL4zSQpgLICG\nqmEzJWUIJu2j2ePrfQuAY86nEpaGadbQC+A3qRJNwixkTencXX/fJ99BZyJvIozP\nDWnWCKxSZAGPdyX6xkOEuxB90jSVRrRilDfi6H4bOGStybUZ8+HuwjkBe8vgfhs5\nZEpFHqd23TPbSfmBYnW77Dk5gNgEy3zsv5iHbkYuKIzaAYQ4I1kndRwl79lWx6+T\nNeiz0MTuMIFH1bz5uyksRoxpRcv6W4PXMEWGPIhax8MGobqdxRiTPbCcV6vBjGeQ\nelMul2D55NKhi65bSRACwUfo5+QJjSVWZvh+4uLl9Ifyc2K7A/W7GDuYbacrbA+J\nZ11ApXpdiERvtNhHqkcA\n=9kHQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ac5089a522457731e576e63b5562d120f3b74c40\nparent e05931b3016ed3d1500df0c5b77402f457ee5686\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1787346890 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787346890 -0400\n\nfeat(code): add `editable` trace metadata (#5737)\n\nDeep Agents Code traces now expose whether the client is an editable\ninstall as a filterable boolean.\n\n---\n\nTrace consumers currently must parse `lc_versions[\"deepagents-code\"]`\nfor a `+editable` suffix. `build_stream_config` now emits an\nalways-present `editable` boolean derived from the same cached PEP 610\nlookup, keeping both values consistent.\n\nTests: focused metadata contract and stream-config tests; `make\nformat_diff`; `make lint_diff`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/6e666be6-44be-5afd-abb0-945fac4d7912)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-21T21:14:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e05931b3016ed3d1500df0c5b77402f457ee5686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e05931b3016ed3d1500df0c5b77402f457ee5686","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e05931b3016ed3d1500df0c5b77402f457ee5686"}],"stats":{"total":11,"additions":8,"deletions":3},"files":[{"sha":"fb0024a466e9990bdb107aff635118c1c451d07a","filename":"libs/code/deepagents_code/config.py","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":3,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e/libs%2Fcode%2Fdeepagents_code%2Fconfig.py","raw_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/raw/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e/libs%2Fcode%2Fdeepagents_code%2Fconfig.py","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/contents/libs%2Fcode%2Fdeepagents_code%2Fconfig.py?ref=23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e","patch":"@@ -2050,6 +2050,9 @@ def build_stream_config(\n     `lc_versions[\"deepagents\"]`; for sibling monorepo packages that suffix\n     identifies workspace HEAD relative to the pinned published SDK baseline.\n \n+    Also records `editable` as an always-present boolean so editable dcode installs\n+    can be filtered without parsing the `lc_versions[\"deepagents-code\"]` suffix.\n+\n     Also records `dcode_experimental=True` when `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL`\n     is enabled, so experimental runs are filterable in trace metadata.\n \n@@ -2120,10 +2123,10 @@ def build_stream_config(\n \n     # Legacy / diagnostic keys preserved for backward-compatibility during the\n     # coding-agent-v1 rollout (not part of the contract).\n+    editable = _is_editable_install()\n+    metadata[\"editable\"] = editable\n     metadata[\"lc_versions\"] = {\n-        \"deepagents-code\": _format_lc_version(\n-            __version__, editable=_is_editable_install()\n-        )\n+        \"deepagents-code\": _format_lc_version(__version__, editable=editable)\n     }\n     deepagents_version = _get_deepagents_version()\n     if deepagents_version is not None:"},{"sha":"f3221583bb7ccb6955d67889b02f0a1dff1144c4","filename":"libs/code/tests/unit_tests/tui/test_textual_adapter.py","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e/libs%2Fcode%2Ftests%2Funit_tests%2Ftui%2Ftest_textual_adapter.py","raw_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/raw/23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e/libs%2Fcode%2Ftests%2Funit_tests%2Ftui%2Ftest_textual_adapter.py","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/contents/libs%2Fcode%2Ftests%2Funit_tests%2Ftui%2Ftest_textual_adapter.py?ref=23b83ad50f63d241d0069a3dc426d43b211adf2e","patch":"@@ -1212,6 +1212,7 @@ def test_versions_contains_cli_version(self) -> None:\n             patch(\"deepagents_code.config._get_deepagents_version\", return_value=None),\n         ):\n             config = build_stream_config(\"t-ver\", assistant_id=None)\n+        assert config[\"metadata\"][\"editable\"] is False\n         assert config[\"metadata\"][\"lc_versions\"] == {\"deepagents-code\": __version__}\n \n     def test_versions_marks_editable_cli_version(self) -> None:\n@@ -1223,6 +1224,7 @@ def test_versions_marks_editable_cli_version(self) -> None:\n             patch(\"deepagents_code.config._get_deepagents_version\", return_value=None),\n         ):\n             config = build_stream_config(\"t-editable\", assistant_id=None)\n+        assert config[\"metadata\"][\"editable\"] is True\n         assert config[\"metadata\"][\"lc_versions\"] == {\n             \"deepagents-code\": f\"{__version__}+editable\"\n         }"}]}